ate talk!</span></p></div><span class=\"boot-screen-index\">Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span></div><div class=\"page-transition-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"page-transition-frame\"></div><span class=\"page-transition-mark\">L</span></div><div class=\"site site--loading\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"site-header-inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav-wrap\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><div class=\"site-nav-desktop\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link nav-link--active\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><button class=\"site-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4pb_\"><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-label\">Menu</span><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></span></button><div id=\"_R_4pb_\" class=\"site-nav-mobile\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-inner\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-links\"><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/buy\"><span>Buy</span><span>01</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link site-nav-mobile-link--active\" href=\"/sell\"><span>Sell</span><span>02</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\"><span>Home Valuation</span><span>03</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/communities\"><span>Communities</span><span>04</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/reviews\"><span>Reviews</span><span>05</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/team\"><span>Team</span><span>06</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/about\"><span>About</span><span>07</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Contact</span><span>08</span></a></div><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-cta\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Get your home value <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></nav></div></header><main class=\"site-main\"><main class=\"editorial-page page-sell\"><section class=\"editorial-hero sell-hero\"><div class=\"editorial-hero-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</div><div class=\"editorial-hero-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Sell with confidence</p></div><div class=\"\"><h1 class=\"editorial-hero-title\">Your home deserves<em>a considered next step.</em></h1></div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-hero-description\">From valuation through closing, we bring a clear strategy, experienced negotiation, and close communication to every Fox Cities sale.</p></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"editorial-hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Get your home value</a><a href=\"#selling-process\" class=\"btn btn--outline-light\">Explore the process</a></div></div></div><div class=\"editorial-hero-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">S</div><div class=\"editorial-hero-footnote\"><span>Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span><span class=\"editorial-hero-footnote-line\"></span><span>Seller representation</span></div></section><section class=\"sell-proof\"><div class=\"sell-proof-intro\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Performance with context</p><p class=\"sell-proof-lead\">A successful sale requires more than putting a property online. It takes accurate positioning, thoughtful presentation, and someone who can guide important decisions without adding pressure.</p></div><div class=\"sell-proof-stats\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team performance\"><div class=\"\"><article class=\"sell-proof-stat\"><span class=\"sell-proof-stat-value\">$27.24M</span><span class=\"sell-proof-stat-label\">Closed volume in 2024</span></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"sell-proof-stat\"><span class=\"sell-proof-stat-value\">76</span><span class=\"sell-proof-stat-label\">Transaction sides in 2024</span></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"sell-proof-stat\"><span class=\"sell-proof-stat-value\">21+</span><span class=\"sell-proof-stat-label\">Years of Fox Cities experience</span></article></div></div><div class=\"sell-proof-note\"><span>RealTrends Verified</span><p>Our 2024 production has been independently verified by RealTrends. It is proof of a process built through consistent local work—not a one-season result.</p></div></section><section class=\"sell-process\" id=\"selling-process\"><div class=\"sell-process-aside\"><span class=\"editorial-section-number\">01 — The plan</span><span class=\"sell-process-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span></div><div class=\"sell-process-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>A clear four-step process</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">From first<em>conversation to closing.</em></h2></div><div class=\"sell-process-list\"><div class=\"\"><article class=\"sell-process-step\"><span class=\"sell-process-step-number\">01</span><div class=\"sell-process-step-content\"><h3>Price with perspective</h3><p>We evaluate recent local sales, current market conditions, your home’s updates, and its individual strengths. The goal is a realistic pricing strategy—not a generic automated estimate.</p></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"sell-process-step\"><span class=\"sell-process-step-number\">02</span><div class=\"sell-process-step-content\"><h3>Prepare with purpose</h3><p>We help you identify the improvements, presentation decisions, and staging priorities most likely to support your sale, so time and budget are focused where they matter.</p></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"sell-process-step\"><span class=\"sell-process-step-number\">03</span><div class=\"sell-process-step-content\"><h3>Launch with intention</h3><p>Your home is positioned with professional presentation, listing syndication, targeted digital exposure, and direct communication with our network of buyers and local agents.</p></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"sell-process-step\"><span class=\"sell-process-step-number\">04</span><div class=\"sell-process-step-content\"><h3>Negotiate to the finish</h3><p>From offers and counteroffers to inspections and closing details, we manage the moving parts with a focus on your timeline, terms, and net outcome.</p></div></article></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sell-valuation-band\"><div class=\"sell-valuation-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"sell-valuation-frame-number\">Value / 01</span><span class=\"sell-valuation-frame-mark\">L</span><span class=\"sell-valuation-frame-label\">A local perspective</span></div><div class=\"sell-valuation-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow editorial-eyebrow--light\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Begin with clarity</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">What is your home<em>really worth?</em></h2><p class=\"sell-valuation-copy\">Start with a personalized valuation from a team that knows the local market. We will look beyond an online estimate and help you understand the real factors shaping your home’s position today.</p></div><div class=\"\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Request your home valuation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"editorial-closing-cta\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Your next move</p><h2>Let’s make your<em>next chapter count.</em></h2><p>Share a little about your home and your timeline. We will help you map a clear path forward.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Get your home value</a></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><p>A three-generation Fox Cities real estate team bringing local perspective, documented performance, and personal guidance to every move.</p><a class=\"footer-text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"footer-navigation\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Explore</p><div class=\"footer-nav-links\"><a href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a href=\"/team\">Team</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-contact\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Direct contact</p><address><p><strong>Diane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\">diane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204289227\">(920) 428-9227</a></p><p><strong>Shane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:shane@lathropteam.com\">shane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204280066\">(920) 428-0066</a></p><p><strong>Oliver Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:oliver@lathropteam.com\">oliver@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19208584424\">(920) 858-4424</a></p></address></div><div class=\"footer-map\"><div class=\"footer-map-header\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Office location</p><span>Appleton, Wisconsin</span></div><div class=\"footer-map-frame\"><iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!